{"unit_id": "tag:01UU:statement", "translation": "上述引理给出了构造微分（differentials）模（module）的第二种方法。具体而言，设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。考虑满足下述条件的所有仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0002>：它们各自映（map）到<MATH_0003>的某个仿射开集（affine open）内。它们构成<MATH_0004>上拓扑（topology）的一个基（basis）。因此，只需定义<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>为这样的开集。直接令（set）<MATH_0007>即可，这里的<MATH_0008>、<MATH_0009>如上文引理<REF_0001>所述。这种做法可行，但用它来构造限制映射（restriction mappings）并验证层条件（sheaf condition），需要稍多一些代数预备知识。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "令"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分", "context": "被构造的模的类型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "引理给出另一种构造的对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "构成一组拓扑基的开集"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映", "context": "说明仿射开集在态射下落入何处"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "包含像的开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "所考察概形上的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "由指定仿射开集构成的拓扑基"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "令", "context": "给出定义值的操作"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "该构造需要定义的映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target