{"unit_id": "tag:01UV:statement", "translation": "设\n<MATH_0001>\n为概形（schemes）的交换图（commutative diagram）。典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0002>与映射（map）<MATH_0003>复合（composed）后得到一个<MATH_0004>-导子（derivation）。由此得到<MATH_0005>-模（modules）之间的典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0006>，再由<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>的伴随性（adjointness）得到一个典范（canonical）的<MATH_0009>-模（module）同态（homomorphism）\n<MATH_0010>\n这个同态由下述性质唯一刻画：<MATH_0011>映（maps）到<MATH_0012>，对任意局部截面（local section）<MATH_0013>（取自<MATH_0014>）皆如此。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composed", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "derivation", "target_term": "导子"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映"}, {"source_term": "local section", "target_term": "局部截面"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "交换图中的对象"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "假设给出的概形图"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "用于复合的第一个映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用于复合的第二个映射"}, {"source_term": "composed", "target_term": "复合", "context": "构成导子的操作"}, {"source_term": "derivation", "target_term": "导子", "context": "复合所得的导子"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "典范映射之间的对象"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "由导子得到的模间映射"}, {"source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性", "context": "得到模同态所用的伴随关系"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "由伴随性得到的同态的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给出同态的类型"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "由伴随性所得的模同态"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映", "context": "描述同态对指定元素的作用"}, {"source_term": "local section", "target_term": "局部截面", "context": "唯一刻画中任取的截面"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UV:proof", "translation": "这是《模（Modules）》引理<REF_0001>的一个特例。在概形（schemes）的情形，也可用余法（conormal）层（sheaves）的函子性（functoriality）（见引理<REF_0002>）和引理<REF_0003>来定义<MATH_0001>。或者，可用该引理最后一行的刻画，将在仿射（affine）片（patches）上定义的映射（maps）粘合（glue）起来（见《代数（Algebra）》式（<REF_0004>））。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "patches", "target_term": "片"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "给出一般引理的章节名"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "可使用另一种定义的情形"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法", "context": "指定所用层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "借助其函子性的对象"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "用来定义给定对象的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "定义局部映射的片的性质"}, {"source_term": "patches", "target_term": "片", "context": "用于局部定义映射的片"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "在仿射片上定义的映射"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "由局部映射得到整体映射的操作"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给出所引等式的章节名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UX:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）。则存在典范（canonical）正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0003>\n其中的映射（maps）由应用引理<REF_0001>得到。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "两个态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "假设给出的两个态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "所得正合列的性质"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列", "context": "引理断言存在的列"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "应用引理得到的列中映射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UX:proof", "translation": "这是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>的层化（sheafified）形式。也可使用适用于赋环空间（ringed spaces）态射（morphisms）的一般形式，见《模（Modules）》引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheafified", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给出代数形式的章节名"}, {"source_term": "sheafified", "target_term": "层化", "context": "从代数版本得到当前版本的方式"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "更一般版本所涉及的空间"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "一般版本适用的态射"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "给出一般版本的章节名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V0:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>的基变换（base change）。记<MATH_0005>为投影（projection）。那么，映射（map）\n<MATH_0006>\n即引理<REF_0001>所给的映射，是同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一个态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一个给定态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二个态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二个给定态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "由给定态射得到新态射的操作"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影", "context": "基变换图中所指定的投影"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "所引引理给出的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "所引映射具有的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V0:proof", "translation": "这是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>的层化（sheafified）形式。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheafified", "target_term": "层化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给出代数形式的章节名"}, {"source_term": "sheafified", "target_term": "层化", "context": "从代数版本得到当前版本的方式"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V1:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>为目标（target）相同的概形（schemes）态射（morphisms）。设<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>为投影（projection）态射（morphisms）。引理<REF_0001>给出的映射（maps）\n<MATH_0005>\n给出一个同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "两个概形态射共有的目标"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所考察态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "具有共同目标的两个态射"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影", "context": "指定后两个态射的类型"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用以构造映射的两个投影态射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "引理给出的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "由这些映射得到的同构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V1:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>，复合（composition）\n<MATH_0001>\n是同构（isomorphism），<MATH_0002>的情形类似。此外，<MATH_0003>的余核（cokernel）是<MATH_0004>，这是由引理<REF_0002>得到的。结论随之成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "cokernel", "target_term": "余核"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "检验同构性的复合"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "给定复合具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "cokernel", "target_term": "余核", "context": "由所引引理确定的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V2:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>局部有限型（locally of finite type），则<MATH_0003>是一个有限型（finite type）的<MATH_0004>-模（module）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "对给定态射的假设"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "所得模具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "结论中判断为有限型的对象"}], "notes": []}
