{"unit_id": "tag:01V3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），则<MATH_0003>是一个<MATH_0004>-模（module），并且是有限表示（finite presentation）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "对给定态射的假设"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "结论所述对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "该模具有的性质"}], "notes": []}
