{"unit_id": "tag:01UY:statement", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>为浸入（immersion），或更一般地，为单态射（monomorphism），则<MATH_0002>为零（zero）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "假设中较特殊的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射", "context": "假设中较一般的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零", "context": "结论所断言的零对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UY:proof", "translation": "这是因为在此情形下<MATH_0001>为同构（isomorphism），因而其余法（conormal）层（sheaf）是平凡的（trivial）。于是<MATH_0002>，这是由引理<REF_0001>得到的。代数版本见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "trivial", "target_term": "平凡的"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "在给定假设下成立的性质"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法", "context": "指定层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "上述同构所对应的层"}, {"source_term": "trivial", "target_term": "平凡的", "context": "同构的余法层具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给出代数版本的章节名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UZ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的概形（schemes）之间的浸入（immersion）。存在典范（canonical）正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0003>\n其中第一个箭头（arrow）由<MATH_0004>诱导，第二个箭头（arrow）来自引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "浸入所关联的两个概形"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "假设给出的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "构造所得正合列的性质"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列", "context": "引理断言存在的列"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "由给定对象诱导的第一个箭头"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "来自所引引理的第二个箭头"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UZ:proof", "translation": "这是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>的层化（sheafified）形式。不过，需要确认第一个箭头（arrow）能在全局（globally）定义。因此，这里解释“由<MATH_0001>诱导”的含义。具体来说，可以假设<MATH_0002>为闭浸入（closed immersion），只需缩小（shrinking）<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>为与<MATH_0005>对应的理想层（sheaf of ideals）。于是<MATH_0006>将子层（subsheaf）<MATH_0007>映（maps）到<MATH_0008>。因而它诱导映射（map）\n<MATH_0009>\n此映射是<MATH_0010>-线性（linear）的。由引理<REF_0002>，它对应于所需的映射（map）\n<MATH_0011>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheafified", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "globally", "target_term": "全局"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "shrinking", "target_term": "缩小"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "linear", "target_term": "线性"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给出代数形式的章节名"}, {"source_term": "sheafified", "target_term": "层化", "context": "从代数版本得到当前版本的方式"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "需要确认可全局定义的箭头"}, {"source_term": "globally", "target_term": "全局", "context": "定义第一个箭头的范围"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "缩小之后可假定的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "shrinking", "target_term": "缩小", "context": "得到闭浸入时使用的操作"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层", "context": "与给定对象对应的层"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层", "context": "指定映射所作用的子对象"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映", "context": "描述对给定子层的作用"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "由对子层的作用诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "linear", "target_term": "线性", "context": "诱导映射的性质"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用所引引理得到的所需映射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0474:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的概形（schemes）之间的浸入（immersion），并假设<MATH_0003>（局部地）有左逆（inverse）。那么，典范（canonical）序列（sequence）\n<MATH_0004>\n即引理<REF_0001>中的序列，是（局部）分裂正合（split exact）的。特别地，若<MATH_0005>是结构态射（structure morphism）<MATH_0006>的截面（section），则映射（map）\n<MATH_0007>\n由<MATH_0008>诱导，并且是同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "左逆"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "split exact", "target_term": "分裂正合"}, {"source_term": "structure morphism", "target_term": "结构态射"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "浸入两端的对象"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "假设给出的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "左逆", "context": "假设中局部存在的逆"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "给定序列的性质"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列", "context": "被判定局部分裂正合的序列"}, {"source_term": "split exact", "target_term": "分裂正合", "context": "在给定假设下局部成立的性质"}, {"source_term": "structure morphism", "target_term": "结构态射", "context": "有给定截面的态射"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "特殊情形中给出的截面"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "由给定对象诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "特殊情形中所得映射的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0474:proof", "translation": "由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>可知，当<MATH_0001>是仿射（affine）的时，结论成立。在一般情形下，可得该序列（sequence）局部分裂正合（locally split exact）。若<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的左逆（inverse），则<MATH_0004>是映射（map）\n<MATH_0005>\n的右逆（inverse），这是由《模（Modules）》引理<REF_0002>得到的。\n由《同调（Homology）》引理<REF_0003>，这推出该序列（sequence）是分裂的（split）。\n最后，若<MATH_0006>为截面（section），则它是浸入（immersion）<MATH_0007>，且在<MATH_0008>上（见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0004>），此时<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "locally split exact", "target_term": "局部分裂正合"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "左逆"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "右逆"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Homology", "target_term": "同调"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂的"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给出仿射情形结论的章节名"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "可直接应用代数结论的情形"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列", "context": "一般情形下所考察的序列"}, {"source_term": "locally split exact", "target_term": "局部分裂正合", "context": "由仿射情形得出的一般结论"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "左逆", "context": "假设给定的左逆"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "具有所述右逆的映射"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "右逆", "context": "由所引引理得到的右逆"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "给出右逆的章节名"}, {"source_term": "Homology", "target_term": "同调", "context": "给出分裂判据的章节名"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列", "context": "由右逆推出分裂性的序列"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂的", "context": "使用右逆推出的序列性质"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "最后所讨论的特殊情形"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "该截面所具有的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "证明截面为浸入的章节名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:060N:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。由引理<REF_0001>，有\n<MATH_0002>\n另一方面，对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>是浸入（immersion），且局部有左逆（inverse）。因此，由引理<REF_0002>得到典范（canonical）短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0004>\n注意，右侧的箭头（arrow）为<MATH_0005>，它确实是分裂（split）满射（surjection）。另一方面，由引理<REF_0003>，有等同（identification）<MATH_0006>。由于在这个等同（identification）中选取了<MATH_0007>，左侧的箭头（arrow）就是映射（map）\n<MATH_0008><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>具体来说，局部截面（local section）<MATH_0009>取自<MATH_0010>的理想（ideal）层（sheaf），经由<MATH_0011>映（maps）到局部截面（local section）<MATH_0012>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "左逆"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "local section", "target_term": "局部截面"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映"}, {"source_term": "local section", "target_term": "局部截面"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "注记考察的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "指定所用的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "局部有左逆的对角态射"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "该对角态射所属的类型"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "左逆", "context": "对角态射局部具有的逆"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "所得短正合列的性质"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列", "context": "由所引引理得到的列"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "短正合列右侧的箭头"}, {"source_term": "split", "target_term": "分裂", "context": "右侧满射的性质"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射", "context": "右侧箭头所属的类型"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同", "context": "第三个引理给出的等同"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同", "context": "包含特定选取的上述等同"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "短正合列左侧的箭头"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "经等同确定的左侧箭头"}, {"source_term": "local section", "target_term": "局部截面", "context": "脚注给出映射作用的输入"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "指定输入截面所属层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "脚注中输入截面所属的层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映", "context": "描述所给映射对该截面的作用"}, {"source_term": "local section", "target_term": "局部截面", "context": "脚注给出映射作用的输出"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:067L:statement", "translation": "设\n<MATH_0001>\n为概形（schemes）的交换图（commutative diagram），其中<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>为浸入（immersions）。则存在典范（canonical）正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0004>\n其中第一个箭头（arrow）来自引理<REF_0001>，第二个来自引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "交换图中的对象"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "假设给出的图"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "图中两个态射的类型"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "所得正合列的性质"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列", "context": "引理断言存在的列"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "说明两处引用所给出的是列中的箭头"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:067L:proof", "translation": "这一结论的代数版本见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给出代数版本的章节名"}], "notes": []}
