{"unit_id": "tag:0G43:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n建议读者参阅交换代数（commutative algebra）章的相应一节（《代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0001>节）和模（modules）层（sheaves）章的相应一节（《模（Modules）》第<REF_0002>节）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "commutative algebra", "target_term": "交换代数"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "commutative algebra", "target_term": "交换代数", "context": "建议参阅的第一章的主题"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第一个引用的章节名"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "指定建议参阅的第二章所述层的类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "建议参阅的第二章所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二个引用的章节名"}], "notes": []}
